# AUTHORED-BY Codex (GPT-6.1 Sol)
# Admission projection: broad schema:Thing domains avoid asserting a global domain
# from the first use of a shared schema.org property. SHACL owns local datatypes.
@prefix schema: <http://schema.org/> .
@prefix dct: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix trips: <https://jeswr.org/ns/trips#> .
